title: "solana-marketplace-escrow"
abstract: "Solana escrow SDK: non-custodial, smart-contract escrow where the vault has no private key, so moderators can release funds but never steal them. P2P marketplace escrow with Anchor PDA program, durable-nonce pre-signing, and atomic Jito settlement. TypeScript, MCP, x402."
